[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2161.03, "timestamp": "00:36:01", "text": "它？它在哪里？它在哪里？考试"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2163.79, "timestamp": "00:36:03", "text": "日期。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2167.03, "timestamp": "00:36:07", "text": "所以，我没有把握好时机。那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2172.87, "timestamp": "00:36:12", "text": "坏的。所以，17 18 19 20 23 24 17 17。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2174.47, "timestamp": "00:36:14", "text": "是的。第三周。是的，第三周"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2176.109, "timestamp": "00:36:16", "text": "继续。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2179.829, "timestamp": "00:36:19", "text": "是的，我要考182。是的，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2181.75, "timestamp": "00:36:21", "text": "有趣的是，我从来没有……我没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2183.75, "timestamp": "00:36:23", "text": "甚至学习。我甚至不知道是什么考试"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2188.47, "timestamp": "00:36:28", "text": "昨天我把这个放在这里了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2190.71, "timestamp": "00:36:30", "text": "看着它，我就想，哇，我……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2194.19, "timestamp": "00:36:34", "text": "甚至知道这些是我的旧文件，兄弟"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2197.109, "timestamp": "00:36:37", "text": "疼痛？我会在……的时候担心的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2199.27, "timestamp": "00:36:39", "text": "日本没问题，我必须专注于"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2201.99, "timestamp": "00:36:41", "text": "从此以后，日语就只剩下一次了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2205.19, "timestamp": "00:36:45", "text": "从下个月开始我就不必喜欢了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2207.589, "timestamp": "00:36:47", "text": "我知道我必须完成它，但是，嗯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2208.43, "timestamp": "00:36:48", "text": "第三"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2215.99, "timestamp": "00:36:55", "text": "好的。是的，第二周和第三周。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2217.91, "timestamp": "00:36:57", "text": "一周内，请告诉我你们是否营业。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2217.92, "timestamp": "00:36:57", "author": "@LordHeadAss002", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/-EWTr8l_W5L2rvpeIbbmfhhB0C_JFG5p8g68fFdW2VO7paKednRMpYHY2A7J0gqpYJkgYp2Vnw=s64-c-k-c0x